TI  - Hyperbolic-SAM: Sharpness-Aware Minimization in Hyperbolic Space for Enhanced Deep Learning Generalization
T2  - EIGHTH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE AND PATTERN RECOGNITION, AIPR 2025, PT 1
LA  - English
