TI  - A Coordinate Attention-Based Fusion Network for HSI-LiDAR Classification With Sharpness-Aware Optimization and Label Propagation
T2  - IEEE ACCESS
LA  - English
KW  - Laser radar
KW  - Hyperspectral imaging
