TI  - Neighborhood and Global Perturbations Supported Sharpness-Aware Minimization in Federated Learning: From Local Tweaks to Global Awareness
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON NETWORK SCIENCE AND ENGINEERING
LA  - English
KW  - Perturbation methods
KW  - Federated learning
KW  - Convergence
KW  - Optimization
KW  - Minimization
